#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:113
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_displayStaticMembers)
#: rc.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Displaying static members makes GDB slower in\n"
"producing data within KDE and Qt.\n"
"It may change the \"signature\" of the data\n"
"which QString and friends rely on,\n"
"but if you need to debug into these values then\n"
"check this option."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:116
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_displayStaticMembers)
#: rc.cpp:131
msgid "Display static &members"
msgstr "Montri statikajn &membrojn"

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:125
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_asmDemangle)
#: rc.cpp:134
msgid ""
"When displaying the disassembled code you\n"
"can select to see the methods' mangled names.\n"
"However, non-mangled names are easier to read."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:128
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_asmDemangle)
#: rc.cpp:139
msgid "Display &demangled names"
msgstr "Montri &malkompilitajn nomojn"

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:141
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_breakOnLoadingLibrary)
#: rc.cpp:142
msgid ""
"If GDB has not seen a library that will be loaded via\n"
"\"dlopen\" then it will refuse to set a breakpoint in that code.\n"
"We can get GDB to stop on a library load and hence\n"
"try to set the pending breakpoints. See the documentation\n"
"for more details relating to this behavior.\n"
"\n"
"If you are not \"dlopen\"ing libs then leave this unchecked."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:144
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_breakOnLoadingLibrary)
#: rc.cpp:151
msgid "Try setting &breakpoints on library loading"
msgstr "Provi meti &haltpunktojn dum ŝargado de biblioteko"

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:156
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_enableFloatingToolBar)
#: rc.cpp:154
msgid ""
"Use the floating toolbar. This toolbar always stays\n"
"on top of all windows so that if the app covers KDevelop\n"
"you have control of the app through the small toolbar. It\n"
"can also be docked into the panel.\n"
"\n"
"This toolbar is in addition to the toolbar in KDevelop."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:159
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_enableFloatingToolBar)
